{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What legends will be told of your exploits in Theden?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While this world may be devoid of hunger, fatigue, and death, it's not without its problems. The world's inhabitants, Zens, constantly fight and bicker, forming clubs and factions as they strive against each other for wealth, power, and influence. The worst of these is The Engineer, a madwoman hidden away in the distant Sky Castle, who stirs up conflict with her army of Constructs, noisy mechanical beings that belch smoke and keep everyone from getting any rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself against The Engineer's machinations by exploring 8 character classes with distinct abilities as you fight your way through both her Constructs and the natural inhabitants of the world, Abstractimals. Gain new powers through hundreds of weapons, armor, pets, artifacts, and consumable items. Make friends and gather Companions to buff yourself as you make your way toward Sky Castle and your final showdown with The Engineer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and reforge any piece of equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classes level independently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affinity system tracks friendship with each Zen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type or transcribe lore entries for EXP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization with hundreds of hairstyles, expressions, facial features, and skintones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize sound, gameplay, and appearance settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entire world made from handcrafted paper art</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Join the Theden Discord to gain advance access to the Adventure Guide, make suggestions, get help, chat with other players, and see an updated roadmap of future changes and releases!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574800?t=1755704534","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574800?t=1755704534","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574800/9927eb77f330bdced0e6fa2ebfb35aad316ac19e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755704534","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574800/9927eb77f330bdced0e6fa2ebfb35aad316ac19e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755704534","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What legends will be told of your exploits in Theden?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While this world may be devoid of hunger, fatigue, and death, it's not without its problems. The world's inhabitants, Zens, constantly fight and bicker, forming clubs and factions as they strive against each other for wealth, power, and influence. The worst of these is The Engineer, a madwoman hidden away in the distant Sky Castle, who stirs up conflict with her army of Constructs, noisy mechanical beings that belch smoke and keep everyone from getting any rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself against The Engineer's machinations by exploring 8 character classes with distinct abilities as you fight your way through both her Constructs and the natural inhabitants of the world, Abstractimals. Gain new powers through hundreds of weapons, armor, pets, artifacts, and consumable items. Make friends and gather Companions to buff yourself as you make your way toward Sky Castle and your final showdown with The Engineer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and reforge any piece of equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classes level independently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affinity system tracks friendship with each Zen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type or transcribe lore entries for EXP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization with hundreds of hairstyles, expressions, facial features, and skintones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize sound, gameplay, and appearance settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entire world made from handcrafted paper art</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Join the Theden Discord to gain advance access to the Adventure Guide, make suggestions, get help, chat with other players, and see an updated roadmap of future changes and releases!</i></p>","developers":["Papermonger LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574800/4589a739399956250452c000e9840dc10d43d30b/header.jpg?t=1755704534","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}